/*
   macshot for Windows — strings this port owns.

   Keys are the English text, exactly as macshot keys its own. This file holds only
   what the Windows build says and the Mac app does not: what Windows names its own
   parts, what its update check and its uploads report, and the hints for the two
   things it does differently. Everything macshot already says is translated in
   macshot/pt-BR.lproj/Localizable.strings and is not repeated here.

   pt-BR
*/

"0 sets no limit of your own. macshot stops at 40,000 px either way — the picture is held whole while it grows." = "0 não define um limite seu. O macshot para em 40.000 px de qualquer forma — a imagem é mantida inteira enquanto cresce.";
